# Adversarial case, ratified by the author 2026-08-04 (panel 015).
# Guards §4.16, which is normative and file-wide: one `???`
# anywhere suspends the unused rule for the WHOLE file — including the unused
# parameter here, which is the shape §4.16's own example has — and suspends
# NOTHING else. The unknown name below is still an error, or a file with one
# hole would stop being checked at all.
function draft(a: i64, b: i64) -> i64
    spare = 1
    return a + nope  #~ unknown_name

function later() -> i64
    ???
